OL,4,BYoro red card overturned, but refs'    
OL,5,Bchief Webb backs decision              
OL,6,GManchester United defender Leny Yoro   
OL,7,Ghas had the red card shown to him at   
OL,8,GAnfield overturned by the Football     
OL,9,GAssociation - even though referees'    
OL,10,Gchief Howard Webb has backed the       
OL,11,Gdecision to send the defender off.     
OL,13,FYoro was dismissed by referee Sam      
OL,14,FBarrott for bringing down Liverpool    
OL,15,Fforward Alexander Isak just eight      
OL,16,Fminutes into Sunday's match.           
